PRIVACY POLICY
Wos Vyak Dictionary

Effective date: September 14, 2026
Developed by: PT Tifa Pratama Jaya

------------------------------------------------------------

Wos Vyak Dictionary ("the App") is developed and published by PT Tifa
Pratama Jaya ("we", "us", "our"). This Privacy Policy explains what
information the App collects, how it is used, and the choices you
have. By downloading or using the App, you agree to the practices
described in this policy.

The App's core function -- looking up Biak (Wos Byak) vocabulary --
works fully offline using a dictionary database stored on your
device. The sections below describe the optional features and
services that do involve data collection.

------------------------------------------------------------
1. INFORMATION WE COLLECT
------------------------------------------------------------

We do not require you to create an account, and the App does not ask
you to enter personal information such as your name, address, or
phone number to use the dictionary.

- Device & usage data: Automatically collected by our analytics
  provider -- device model, operating system version, app version,
  language settings, crash logs, and general usage patterns (e.g.,
  which screens or features are used).

- Advertising identifiers: Your device's advertising ID (e.g.,
  Google Advertising ID) and general, non-precise data used by our
  ad provider to serve and measure ads.

- Purchase data: If you choose to make an in-app donation, the
  transaction is processed entirely by Google Play Billing. We
  receive confirmation that a donation was made, but we do not
  receive or store your payment card, bank details, or other
  payment credentials.

- Dictionary sync data: If you use the optional "update/sync"
  feature, the App contacts our server to check for and download
  new dictionary entries. This exchange does not include personal
  information about you.

------------------------------------------------------------
2. OPTIONAL INTERNET FEATURES
------------------------------------------------------------

The App is offline-first: the dictionary itself works without an
internet connection. An internet connection is only used, at your
choice, to:

- Check for and download dictionary content updates.
- Load and display advertisements.
- Send anonymized analytics events.
- Process an in-app donation through Google Play Billing, should
  you choose to make one.

If you do not enable sync, decline ad personalization where offered,
or never use the donation feature, the App continues to function as
a local, offline dictionary.

------------------------------------------------------------
3. ADVERTISING
------------------------------------------------------------

The App displays advertisements to support continued development,
served through a third-party advertising network (such as Google
AdMob). This network may use your advertising ID and general device
information to select and measure ads, and may deliver ads based on
your interests unless you opt out.

You can limit ad personalization from your device settings (on
Android: Settings > Google > Ads > "Opt out of Ads Personalization"
or "Delete advertising ID"). This does not stop ads from appearing
but limits how they are targeted.

------------------------------------------------------------
4. ANALYTICS
------------------------------------------------------------

We use a third-party analytics service (such as Google Firebase
Analytics) to understand how the App is used and to identify and fix
crashes or bugs. This data is aggregated and is not used by us to
identify you personally.

------------------------------------------------------------
5. DONATIONS AND IN-APP PURCHASES
------------------------------------------------------------

Any voluntary donation made within the App is processed by Google
Play Billing under Google's own privacy and payment terms. We never
see or store your card number, billing address, or other payment
credentials -- Google handles that transaction directly.

------------------------------------------------------------
6. THIRD-PARTY SERVICES
------------------------------------------------------------

The App relies on the following third-party services, each governed
by its own privacy policy:

- Google AdMob -- advertising delivery and measurement.
- Google Firebase Analytics -- usage analytics and crash diagnostics.
- Google Play Billing -- processing of optional in-app donations.

You can review Google's practices at:
https://policies.google.com/privacy

------------------------------------------------------------
7. DATA SHARING
------------------------------------------------------------

We do not sell your personal information. Data is shared only with
the third-party service providers listed above, to the extent
necessary for them to provide advertising, analytics, and payment
processing functionality within the App.

------------------------------------------------------------
8. DATA STORAGE AND SECURITY
------------------------------------------------------------

The dictionary database is stored locally on your device. Data
collected by our analytics and advertising providers is stored and
secured according to their respective infrastructure and security
practices. We take reasonable measures to protect any data
associated with the App's optional online features from
unauthorized access.

------------------------------------------------------------
9. DATA RETENTION
------------------------------------------------------------

Analytics and advertising data is retained by our third-party
providers according to their own retention schedules. Locally stored
dictionary data remains on your device until you clear the App's
data or uninstall the App.

------------------------------------------------------------
10. CHILDREN'S PRIVACY
------------------------------------------------------------

The App is intended for a general audience and is not directed at
children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information
from children. If you believe a child has provided personal
information through the App, please contact us so we can address it.

------------------------------------------------------------
11. YOUR CHOICES
------------------------------------------------------------

- Use the App without enabling dictionary sync -- the core
  dictionary remains fully offline.
- Limit ad personalization or reset your advertising ID from your
  device settings.
- Uninstall the App at any time to remove locally stored data from
  your device.
- Contact us to ask questions about how your data is handled.

------------------------------------------------------------
12. CHANGES TO THIS POLICY
------------------------------------------------------------

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time, for example
when we add new features or change service providers. Changes will
be posted on this page with an updated effective date. Continued use
of the App after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the
revised policy.

